{"id":"89eac554f6aa8842","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-structure.md","title":"Bounded Partial Order of Interpretability Degrees","display":"thm-degree-structure — Bounded Partial Order of Interpretability Degrees","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-structure","aliases":["67-thm-degree-structure"],"display":"thm-degree-structure — Bounded Partial Order of Interpretability Degrees","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-transitivity]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"chapter opening; bottom and top elements","source_printed_pages":[94,95],"source_pdf_pages":[105,106],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"local-proof-recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-structure — Bounded Partial Order of Interpretability Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140f19e2806d749f\" href=\"?note=140f19e2806d749f\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity\">67-thm-interpretability-transitivity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"chapter opening; bottom and top elements"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span><span>95</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span><span>106</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a> 中的一致 r.e. 基础理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，使用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>可解释性复合的传递性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140f19e2806d749f\" href=\"?note=140f19e2806d749f\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity\">67-thm-interpretability-transitivity</a>；等价类及序均按上述构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a\\leq_Ta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a\\leq_Ta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Tc)\\to a\\leq_Tc).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Tc)\\to a\\leq_Tc).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Ta)\\to a=b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Ta)\\to a=b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0_T\\ne\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T\\leq_Ta\\leq_T\\mathbf1_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0_T\\ne\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T\\leq_Ta\\leq_T\\mathbf1_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书印刷94页的偏序说明及95页的最小、最大度说明。局部论证：恒等解释给出反身性；解释复合给出传递性；若两个度相互比较，它们的代表理论相互可解释，故等价类相同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq A\">\\(T\\subseteq A\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\unlhd A\">\\(T\\unlhd A\\)</span>；不一致理论证明任意翻译后的公理，故所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 均可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\bot\">\\(T+\\bot\\)</span> 中解释。反向不成立：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\bot\\unlhd T\">\\(T+\\bot\\unlhd T\\)</span>，不一致的源理论会使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 同时证明某句的翻译及其否定，违背 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致。因此两个端点不同。</p>\n<p>旧文件的无来源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> 原语已展开为三条量化公理。本原子不承担密度结论；书中确实存在密度定理，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2b5b6ad45b10aef\" href=\"?note=f2b5b6ad45b10aef\" title=\"67-thm-degree-splitting-density\">67-thm-degree-splitting-density</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity","status":"resolved","id":"140f19e2806d749f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-transitivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-degree-structure]] 中的一致 r.e. 基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$，使用其 $D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity","status":"resolved","id":"140f19e2806d749f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"可解释性复合的传递性见 [[67-thm-interpretability-transitivity]]；等价类及序均按上述构造。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-degree-splitting-density","status":"resolved","id":"f2b5b6ad45b10aef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"旧文件的无来源 $\\mathrm{Poset}$ 原语已展开为三条量化公理。本原子不承担密度结论；书中确实存在密度定理，见 [[67-thm-degree-splitting-density]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(a\\leq_Ta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Tc)\\to a\\leq_Tc).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;((a\\leq_Tb\\land b\\leq_Ta)\\to a=b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf0_T\\ne\\mathbf1_T\\ \\land\\ \\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T\\leq_Ta\\leq_T\\mathbf1_T).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"T\\unlhd A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\bot\\unlhd T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false}],"bytes":2122,"backlinks":[{"id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]，偏序性质见 [[67-thm-degree-structure]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-structure]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","140f19e2806d749f","f2b5b6ad45b10aef"]}